0px; line-height: 1.4;\">\n                                                                Robust security solutions designed to protect your sensitive patient data from evolving cyber threats.\n                                                            </p>\n                                                            <a href=\"https://www.carbonelle.com.au/antivirus-security\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #3730a3; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px;\">Explore &rarr;</a>\n                                                        </td></tr>\n                                                    </table>\n                                                </td>\n                                            </tr>\n\n                                          <tr>\n                                                <!-- Card 1 -->\n                                                <td class=\"stack-col\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n                                                    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px;\">\n                                                        <tr><td style=\"padding: 15px;\">\n                                                            <p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 5px 0;\">\n                                                                ⚙️ IT Support\n                                                            </p>\n                                                            <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;\">\n                                                                Reliable and responsive technical support to resolve any IT issues your practice may encounter.\n                                                            </p>\n                                                   